  "youtube": {
    "title": "Nobody Texts You First. Here's Why.",
    "description": "Always the one who texts first? Then one day you stop... and the silence feels like an answer.\n\nBut here's what's really happening: everyone is waiting for someone else to go first. Psychologists ran 13 experiments with more than 5,900 people and found that people consistently underestimate how much a simple \"thinking of you\" message is appreciated. The more unexpected it is, the more it means.\n\nIf someone crossed your mind today, text them first.\n\nResearch: Liu, Rim, Min & Min, \"The Surprise of Reaching Out: Appreciated More Than We Think\", Journal of Personality and Social Psychology (2023).\n\n#friendship #loneliness #psychology #selfimprovement #animation #storytime",
